      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+1, I agree. Why not take a similar approach to the old particle limiter? The old particle limiter was unfinished and hard to adjust, which is why it was off by default. I don't see why this should be any different.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
