      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To be clear, you can turn on/off the DB limiter without restarting the application. The only thing that requires an application restart is if you edit the limits themselves.\n\nWe're aware this isn't ideal, but this is our first iteration on the system. Future iterations will provide UI for editing in-app without a restart being required.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
