  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-03-22T13:08:21.207Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As it stands, the difficult in adjusting the (by default fairly strict) limits makes this non-user friendly.\n\nHaving it on by default may catch players unaware as to why DBs are inactive, even if they have a powerful enough system to manage. \n\nIt has been stated that this feature is being rushed out due to high demand. Those who want the feature can enable it at there discretion.\n(And can be made aware of it via the announcements panel)",
